[{"id":"CN-MOD-002","type":"basic","priority":1,"deck":"计算机网络","tags":["HTTP/2","多路复用"],"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/computer-network/计算机网络(六)HTTPS 与现代 HTTP.md","articleTitle":"计算机网络(六)HTTPS 与现代 HTTP","articlePath":"posts/36cb963b/","articles":[{"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/computer-network/计算机网络(六)HTTPS 与现代 HTTP.md","articleTitle":"计算机网络(六)HTTPS 与现代 HTTP","articlePath":"posts/36cb963b/"}],"articleIndex":2,"articleCount":13,"questionHtml":"\u003cp>HTTP/2 的 message、stream、frame、connection 如何分层？\u003c/p>\n","answerHtml":"\u003cp>message 是 HTTP 请求/响应语义，stream 是一次逻辑交换，frame 是在线路上传输的单位，connection 承载多个 stream。\u003c/p>\n","explanationHtml":"\u003cp>HTTP/2 让不同 stream 的帧交错，缓解应用层队头阻塞；但底层 TCP 丢包仍可能阻塞按序字节交付。\u003c/p>\n\u003cp>HTTP/2 的层级可以画成：\u003c/p>\n\u003cfigure class=\"highlight text\">\u003ctable>\u003ctr>\u003ctd class=\"gutter\">\u003cpre>\u003cspan class=\"line\">1\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">2\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">3\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">4\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003c/pre>\u003c/td>\u003ctd class=\"code\">\u003cpre>\u003cspan class=\"line\">一个 connection\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">  ├─ stream 1：一个逻辑请求/响应\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">  │    └─ 多个 frame\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">  └─ stream 2：另一个逻辑请求/响应\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003c/pre>\u003c/td>\u003c/tr>\u003c/table>\u003c/figure>\n\u003cp>帧可以交错，但它们仍共享底层 TCP 的按序字节流；因此应用层队头阻塞减轻了，传输层丢包影响没有消失。\u003c/p>\n","multiple":false,"correct":[],"options":[]},{"id":"fastapi-0141-jwt-not-encryption","type":"basic","priority":1,"deck":"FastAPI","tags":["JWT","密钥"],"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/fastapi/FastAPI(七)认证授权与接口安全.md","articleTitle":"FastAPI(七)认证授权与接口安全","articlePath":"posts/f30a7c3d/","articles":[{"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/fastapi/FastAPI(七)认证授权与接口安全.md","articleTitle":"FastAPI(七)认证授权与接口安全","articlePath":"posts/f30a7c3d/"}],"articleIndex":3,"articleCount":4,"questionHtml":"\u003cp>为什么 JWT 不能当作加密数据保存秘密？\u003c/p>\n","answerHtml":"\u003cp>JWT 的常见形式是可读取的编码加签名；签名保证未被篡改，不会隐藏 payload 内容。\u003c/p>\n","explanationHtml":"\u003cp>持有 token 的客户端可以解码 payload，因此只能放置非敏感的 subject、过期时间和 scope。服务器仍必须验证签名、算法和 \u003ccode>exp\u003c/code>，并把密钥放在受保护的配置来源。需要保密的数据放在服务端存储或真正的加密方案中，不能靠把字段名改得不明显来保护。\u003c/p>\n","multiple":false,"correct":[],"options":[]},{"id":"fastapi-0141-middleware-order","type":"basic","priority":1,"deck":"FastAPI","tags":["中间件","顺序"],"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/fastapi/FastAPI(九)请求管线与错误处理.md","articleTitle":"FastAPI(九)请求管线与错误处理","articlePath":"posts/52af630c/","articles":[{"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/fastapi/FastAPI(九)请求管线与错误处理.md","articleTitle":"FastAPI(九)请求管线与错误处理","articlePath":"posts/52af630c/"}],"articleIndex":1,"articleCount":3,"questionHtml":"\u003cp>中间件顺序为什么会改变结果？\u003c/p>\n","answerHtml":"\u003cp>中间件按栈进入、反向回程；外层中间件可以包住内层的异常、耗时和响应头处理。\u003c/p>\n","explanationHtml":"\u003cp>先添加的中间件通常处在更外层，因此它的进入逻辑更早、回程逻辑更晚。CORS、压缩、Host 校验和自定义异常/计时组合时，顺序会决定错误是否带 CORS 头、耗时是否包含下游以及响应是否被压缩。修改顺序后至少用成功、校验失败和异常三种原始响应比较状态与头。\u003c/p>\n","multiple":false,"correct":[],"options":[]},{"id":"fastapi-0141-http-exception-handler","type":"basic","priority":1,"deck":"FastAPI","tags":["异常","Problem"],"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/fastapi/FastAPI(九)请求管线与错误处理.md","articleTitle":"FastAPI(九)请求管线与错误处理","articlePath":"posts/52af630c/","articles":[{"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/fastapi/FastAPI(九)请求管线与错误处理.md","articleTitle":"FastAPI(九)请求管线与错误处理","articlePath":"posts/52af630c/"}],"articleIndex":3,"articleCount":3,"questionHtml":"\u003cp>什么时候应该自定义 \u003ccode>HTTPException\u003c/code> 或验证异常处理器？\u003c/p>\n","answerHtml":"\u003cp>当多个端点需要统一的状态码、媒体类型和错误字段时，使用处理器集中映射；单个局部业务错误仍可直接抛出 \u003ccode>HTTPException\u003c/code>。\u003c/p>\n","explanationHtml":"\u003cp>处理器把异常转换成稳定的 Problem 契约，客户端只需解析一种错误形状。验证错误要保留 \u003ccode>loc\u003c/code>，HTTPException 要保留状态码和必要的 headers；不要把响应模型错误吞成 422，也不要在错误正文里暴露堆栈和秘密。处理器本身应有正向和负向响应测试。\u003c/p>\n","multiple":false,"correct":[],"options":[]},{"id":"fastapi-0141-router-vs-mount","type":"basic","priority":1,"deck":"FastAPI","tags":["路由组合","ASGI"],"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/fastapi/FastAPI(六)应用结构与生命周期.md","articleTitle":"FastAPI(六)应用结构与生命周期","articlePath":"posts/d0ce794d/","articles":[{"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/fastapi/FastAPI(六)应用结构与生命周期.md","articleTitle":"FastAPI(六)应用结构与生命周期","articlePath":"posts/d0ce794d/"}],"articleIndex":1,"articleCount":3,"questionHtml":"\u003cp>\u003ccode>include_router\u003c/code> 与 \u003ccode>Mount\u003c/code> 的边界是什么？\u003c/p>\n","answerHtml":"\u003cp>\u003ccode>include_router\u003c/code> 把路由并入同一 FastAPI 应用；\u003ccode>Mount\u003c/code> 挂载独立 ASGI 应用，通常保留独立文档、中间件或生命周期。\u003c/p>\n","explanationHtml":"\u003cp>二者都能改变 URL 前缀，但所有权不同。共享认证、异常处理和 OpenAPI 时使用 \u003ccode>include_router\u003c/code>；需要隔离协议、文档或资源生命周期时才使用 \u003ccode>Mount\u003c/code>。把一个普通路由拆成子应用会增加调试和部署边界，不能只因为目录想分层就选择 Mount。\u003c/p>\n","multiple":false,"correct":[],"options":[]},{"id":"pytest-config-precedence","type":"basic","priority":2,"deck":"Pytest","tags":["配置解析"],"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/pytest/Pytest(八)配置与套件组织.md","articleTitle":"Pytest(八)配置与套件组织","articlePath":"posts/26397f68/","articles":[{"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/pytest/Pytest(八)配置与套件组织.md","articleTitle":"Pytest(八)配置与套件组织","articlePath":"posts/26397f68/"}],"articleIndex":3,"articleCount":3,"questionHtml":"\u003cp>多个 pytest 配置文件同时存在时如何选择？\u003c/p>\n","answerHtml":"\u003cp>Pytest 按发现规则选择首个匹配配置，命令行 -c 可显式指定；不是把所有文件按键合并。\u003c/p>\n","explanationHtml":"\u003cp>配置文件不是按键逐个合并的清单；Pytest 按发现规则选择一个入口，\u003ccode>-c\u003c/code> 可以显式指定入口，命令行再覆盖配置项。排查时先把选择结果打印出来：\u003c/p>\n\u003cfigure class=\"highlight bash\">\u003ctable>\u003ctr>\u003ctd class=\"gutter\">\u003cpre>\u003cspan class=\"line\">1\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">2\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003c/pre>\u003c/td>\u003ctd class=\"code\">\u003cpre>\u003cspan class=\"line\">python -m pytest --trace-config --collect-only -q\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">python -m pytest -c config/pytest-ci.ini -q\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003c/pre>\u003c/td>\u003c/tr>\u003c/table>\u003c/figure>\n\u003cp>重点核对 invocation directory、\u003ccode>rootdir\u003c/code>、\u003ccode>inipath\u003c/code> 和最终命令行。项目保留一个权威配置，CI 固定工作目录或显式使用 \u003ccode>-c\u003c/code>，才能避免“本地用了 pyproject、流水线用了 pytest.ini”的漂移。\u003c/p>\n","multiple":false,"correct":[],"options":[]},{"id":"python-iteration-yield-return","type":"basic","priority":1,"deck":"Python 基础","tags":["Python","生成器","yield","return"],"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/python/Python(六)迭代器、生成器与装饰器.md","articleTitle":"Python(六)迭代器、生成器与装饰器","articlePath":"posts/be636c04/","articles":[{"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/python/Python(六)迭代器、生成器与装饰器.md","articleTitle":"Python(六)迭代器、生成器与装饰器","articlePath":"posts/be636c04/"},{"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/python/Python(十二)项目实战.md","articleTitle":"Python(十二)项目实战","articlePath":"posts/c55cda53/"}],"articleIndex":2,"articleCount":4,"questionHtml":"\u003cp>生成器中 \u003ccode>yield\u003c/code> 与 \u003ccode>return\u003c/code> 的差别是什么？\u003c/p>\n","answerHtml":"\u003cp>\u003ccode>yield\u003c/code> 产出一个值并暂停，\u003ccode>return\u003c/code> 结束生成器；带值的 return 成为 StopIteration 的 value。\u003c/p>\n","explanationHtml":"\u003cp>\u003ccode>yield\u003c/code> 把一次执行切成多个阶段，\u003ccode>return\u003c/code> 则结束生成器并把值放进 \u003ccode>StopIteration.value\u003c/code>：\u003c/p>\n\u003cfigure class=\"highlight python\">\u003ctable>\u003ctr>\u003ctd class=\"gutter\">\u003cpre>\u003cspan class=\"line\">1\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">2\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">3\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">4\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">5\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">6\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">7\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">8\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">9\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">10\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003c/pre>\u003c/td>\u003ctd class=\"code\">\u003cpre>\u003cspan class=\"line\">\u003cspan class=\"keyword\">def\u003c/span> \u003cspan class=\"title function_\">numbers\u003c/span>():\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">    \u003cspan class=\"keyword\">yield\u003c/span> \u003cspan class=\"number\">1\u003c/span>\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">    \u003cspan class=\"keyword\">return\u003c/span> \u003cspan class=\"string\">&quot;done&quot;\u003c/span>\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">iterator = numbers()   \u003cspan class=\"comment\"># 此时函数体还没有执行\u003c/span>\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">\u003cspan class=\"built_in\">print\u003c/span>(\u003cspan class=\"built_in\">next\u003c/span>(iterator))  \u003cspan class=\"comment\"># 1\u003c/span>\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">\u003cspan class=\"keyword\">try\u003c/span>:\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">    \u003cspan class=\"built_in\">next\u003c/span>(iterator)\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">\u003cspan class=\"keyword\">except\u003c/span> StopIteration \u003cspan class=\"keyword\">as\u003c/span> error:\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">    \u003cspan class=\"built_in\">print\u003c/span>(error.value) \u003cspan class=\"comment\"># done\u003c/span>\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003c/pre>\u003c/td>\u003c/tr>\u003c/table>\u003c/figure>\n\u003cp>普通 \u003ccode>for\u003c/code> 只消费 \u003ccode>yield\u003c/code> 的值，不展示 return 值；主体只有在 \u003ccode>next()\u003c/code>、\u003ccode>for\u003c/code> 或其他消费动作发生时才推进。因此错误和资源占用也可能延迟到消费阶段。\u003c/p>\n","multiple":false,"correct":[],"options":[]},{"id":"testing-basics-a06-concept-1","type":"basic","priority":1,"deck":"测试基础","tags":["测试点","测试用例"],"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/testing-basics/测试基础(六)功能测试用例设计.md","articleTitle":"测试基础(六)功能测试用例设计","articlePath":"posts/cd81672d/","articles":[{"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/testing-basics/测试基础(六)功能测试用例设计.md","articleTitle":"测试基础(六)功能测试用例设计","articlePath":"posts/cd81672d/"}],"articleIndex":5,"articleCount":7,"questionHtml":"\u003cp>测试点和测试用例有什么区别？\u003c/p>\n","answerHtml":"\u003cp>测试点表达要探索的风险或条件；测试用例把它落实为可复现的前置、数据、步骤、预期和清理。\u003c/p>\n","explanationHtml":"\u003cp>“验证登录失败限制”是测试点，仍不能由另一位执行者直接判定。补上账号状态、失败次数、输入、动作、预期锁定状态和恢复方式后，才成为一条或多条测试用例。测试点适合做范围清单，用例适合执行和追踪；不要用几十个模糊测试点宣称覆盖完整。\u003c/p>\n","multiple":false,"correct":[],"options":[]}]